          "name": "Sequence ID",
          "type": "FMovieSceneSequenceID"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "FInstanceHandle",
      "docs": "Finds a (sub)sequence with the given ID somewhere in the hierarchy of the given reference instance\nThis method will look up the hierarchy root from the given instance handle, and then look for the appropriate sub-instance with the\ngiven sequence ID.\n@param InstanceHandle  The reference instance handle used to locate the relevant sequence hierarchy to explore. Does not have to be a root instance.\n@param SequenceID      An absolute (accumulated) sequence ID to look for in the hierarchy."
